{"availability":"available","full":"mazeduldev/photograph","name":"photograph","description":"Dynamic image gallery using Pexels API and Next.js. You can create your collection of favorite images. Data and files are hosted in Netlify Blobs storage.","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":3,"forks":1,"created":"2024-05-04T12:13:44Z","updated":"2025-04-27T19:35:16Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://photograph-mzd.netlify.app","topics":["image-gallery","netlify","nextjs","pexels-api"],"demo":"https://photograph-mzd.netlify.app/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T20:11:15.079Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T20:11:15.079Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T20:11:15.079Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T20:11:15.079Z","stars":3,"forks":1}],"technologies":["Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["This is a dynamic image gallery using Pexels API and Next.js. This project is bootstrapped with create-next-app. It uses Netlify Blobs for data storage and Netlify Image CDN for serving optimized images.","Landing page fetches a list of curated images from Pexels API. User can click on the image to view in detailed mode. User can also use the search functionality to find images of any topic. Moreover, authenticated users are allowed to like any image and create his/her own collection of liked images. From the user profile page, user can upload profile picture and change password."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/mazeduldev/photograph/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"14366bf752aa5d8e3df38840ef0f983565c072adb25d6e5e72996db235aea487","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T20:11:15.170Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T20:11:15.170Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"This is a dynamic image gallery using Pexels API and Next.js. This project is bootstrapped with create-next-app. It uses Netlify Blobs for data storage and Netlify Image CDN for serving optimized images.","sourceU